                  <nc xml:id="m-79aef6e5-0ca5-481c-af73-709fe679e6f3" pname="d" oct="3" tilt="se" /></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-2e5dbd54-d320-4d76-9e35-0f0726952a82" facs="#m-03509d2c-d438-4560-b6ee-2b929e4402e9" form="maior" /><custos xml:id="m-68fa7a8c-04b9-4657-bd27-c37d2bc8adb7" facs="#m-3ad2e618-e397-4624-ad9b-90bdef15b34b" pname="d" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-2daf986a-6166-468f-8e08-33eca4b28f01"><lg xml:id="m-8a852ff5-3f9e-46f0-aff4-e84f4e191ba9"><l xml:id="m-94dd4b6d-abb9-442a-9cad-7028f228fbd5" facs="#m-b951901f-955e-4c37-9777-0ff559bf4003" label="text-like">Ianuary 15: Our Lady of Prompt Succor</l><l xml:id="m-62775053-b4d2-4973-9b3d-82d662547cc7" facs="#m-9518cfe9-95fc-4390-b14f-768e68d22132" label="ambiguous">d2)</l><l xml:id="m-ff29bcd0-5a03-4913-be49-6f7f0ef7a3ad" facs="#m-cc758318-b441-4737-8183-7ae5476fa7bb" label="lyrics-like">rum saécu-la. A-men.</l><l xml:id="m-dbaa8f6b-8600-44a0-b99c-928ed34b793c" facs="#m-630a73b1-2583-47f0-a654-746b8d49952c" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Dómine Jesu Christe. (9).</l><l xml:id="m-e0884c31-b5cd-4c68-8edc-80c332f0dd1c" facs="#m-19eb79bb-5feb-423b-9edf-c7b2b3171ee5" label="ambiguous">JANUARY 15</l><l xml:id="m-47ba0a02-5981-432a-87b0-3df42d72d402" facs="#m-76e089f0-3ece-4915-b2d5-df2e0355f027" label="text-like">OUR LADY OF PROMPT SUCCOR</l><l xml:id="m-dac5a104-cdfb-4bf0-916d-357b9cdeb474" facs="#m-89c3c3fa-5605-471b-b476-3cd3069b7fb9" label="text-like">In the Province of New-Orleans, principal Patroness</l><l xml:id="m-30d404fe-bfe9-47fe-9a9a-39a5046e6d37" facs="#m-829c9016-a0fc-4d80-9854-914e2b738aaa" label="ambiguous">First class</l><l xml:id="m-a3adc513-e889-4919-b9f5-52f51295c6bc" facs="#m-1e916b7b-e217-4572-9d42-3e0959ae8b59" label="text-like">AT FIRST VESPERS</l><l xml:id="m-189a9ae6-6a60-4cdb-987f-88bd4f7e84f9" facs="#m-36390f8d-f78b-4bd9-b96a-128fb3eafdc3" label="text-like">All as at second Vespers, p. (16), except the following:</l><l xml:id="m-34878dcf-373d-42e7-ace6-7b7d31e1bf92" facs="#m-6da31adf-e6ec-45da-bbe7-31be4d18de8f" label="lyrics-like">At Magn. Ant. Sáncta Maria. p. 1254.</l><l xml:id="m-e0a4ec93-e306-446e-8c4a-b6ea6c04031d" facs="#m-ee89c55e-1cea-4da7-a36f-f5f0dc644091" label="text-like">Prayer. Clementissime. as below.</l><l xml:id="m-6ad3ff52-b7d0-4c02-8f40-716f22d33e0e" facs="#m-916feb0c-4bd2-48f0-8b73-9fa74f43cfea" label="text-like">AT MASS</l><l xml:id="m-ecd9e2de-eabc-42b1-871f-811c93a76000" facs="#m-d18db420-aeab-4297-a1c9-1ffed6c1011d" label="lyrics-like">Introit. Gaudeámus. p. 1556.</l><l xml:id="m-0706e144-14b3-4dd6-afb7-ba3b3cf7c2bc" facs="#m-a4bd6e9b-adc9-4f15-ac10-78f23ba4bb91" label="ambiguous">Collect</l><l xml:id="m-57518d37-7c9d-4f30-b194-1bf96aa2c6dd" facs="#m-14dc05f0-e836-423a-ab57-4bf8f5a2d143" label="lyrics-like">"Lementissime Jesu, qui divi-concéde propitius; ut ejus patro¬</l><l xml:id="m-e810a55d-036e-4dcd-83f5-957c58d2e262" facs="#m-547bad2e-4394-4b96-9b37-f8b0508d57a2" label="lyrics-like">Ltias misericórdiae tuae in cinio“a cunctis malis mentis et</l><l xml:id="m-039ae26b-ecae-4d51-97c6-1ac02e669b2e" facs="#m-4cba2153-44cb-4e07-95a3-7545b21731b6" label="lyrics-like">sinu Matris Maríae collocásti:tcórporis liberémur : Qui vivis.</l><l xml:id="m-03dfbe6b-0079-4ab5-9a36-70c01979be2a" facs="#m-091af530-fbaf-4a80-8b6c-8cc918cfc969" label="ambiguous">Epistle. Ego quasi vitis. p. 1612 1.</l><l xml:id="m-3331b51c-4089-4e1b-a1f8-a7f85026d937" facs="#m-7b051dcb-3f3a-41db-bd83-db5abc66bc48" label="ambiguous">Grad. H.</l><l xml:id="m-1b0a15fb-7be1-4a89-b7a5-20368e50d30b" facs="#m-86052f80-e284-4c74-a6bc-3264ef1af83c" label="ambiguous">1.</l><l xml:id="m-82701606-22e1-4954-9424-0fcb00273d93" facs="#m-bd8b18d2-d34c-4c6f-82de-20ed598987a0" label="lyrics-like">ta “formósa</l><l xml:id="m-e4fec468-a09d-4f7d-82ed-aa7eaf830f0e" facs="#m-ab5486b9-d6df-4640-a5ce-52c2964390e4" label="lyrics-like">et su-á-vis es, fi-li-a</l><l xml:id="m-f7c1f16f-a18c-41e6-96dc-0bc02a680021" facs="#m-67fe0ae2-15d3-4c42-b976-bfdf6ca2552f" label="ambiguous">4 O¬</l><l xml:id="m-b6b69840-220a-42e0-8e3b-90de8067bde9" facs="#m-d5a83d5d-2880-4696-be9f-88144f21ced8" label="ambiguous">St¬</l><l xml:id="m-72d9da6c-7c6e-4a48-b647-293160dd668a" facs="#m-61dd6d3b-6571-41de-afe0-7bb46b280cf4" label="lyrics-like">púl-chra</l><l xml:id="m-317d7ccd-41f1-4940-987f-50eb0ef8399f" facs="#m-fa29590f-d4a5-4073-ac52-07ccc5dc0230" label="lyrics-like">ut lú-na,</l><l xml:id="m-7b05e0f5-115a-4871-bbe2-d07500f3c9d9" facs="#m-0b07d135-7143-40ce-9b0f-1e8145fbfc86" label="text-like">on,</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
